<title>NETHERLANDS: NEDAP H1 NET 6.7 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>NEDAP H1 NET 6.7 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.00 vs   n.a.</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.7  vs   5.9</p>
<p>    Turnover				94.2  vs  84.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    10.6  vs   9.5</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.1  vs   0.2 </p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Nederlandse Apparatenfabriek Nedap.</p>
<p>The company said it expected 1997 full-year profit growth to</p>
<p>exceed 1996's 16 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
